# Text files keep LF in every checkout. Everything under public/ is served byte for byte and its
# sha256 is recorded in public/provenance.json, so git must never convert it.
* text=auto eol=lf
public/** -text
# Licence texts are copied verbatim from the upstream project; their own trailing spaces stay.
public/licenses/* -whitespace
*.mp4 binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
